# Store every text file with LF in the repository and check it out with LF on
# every platform. Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true gets a
# CRLF working tree, and `npm run lint` fails on all 70 source files because the
# Biome formatter expects LF — while CI, running on Linux, passes. This also
# matches end_of_line = lf in .editorconfig.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never convert.
*.webp binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
